ing, and monetization are included.\",\"register.usernameLabel\":\"Username\",\"register.usernamePlaceholder\":\"Choose a username\",\"register.emailLabel\":\"Email\",\"register.emailPlaceholder\":\"Work email address\",\"register.passwordLabel\":\"Password\",\"register.passwordPlaceholder\":\"Create a strong password\",\"register.confirmPasswordLabel\":\"Confirm password\",\"register.confirmPasswordPlaceholder\":\"Repeat your password\",\"register.submitting\":\"Creating…\",\"register.submit\":\"Sign up\",\"register.alreadyHaveAccount\":\"Already have an account?\",\"register.signInToContinue\":\"Sign in to continue\",\"register.asideAria\":\"Highlights for new accounts\",\"register.asideTitle\":\"Host, stream, and earn from your videos\",\"register.asideSubtitle\":\"Upload from your browser, a remote link, or FTP. We encode every file and stream it worldwide while you earn from ads and referrals.\",\"register.bullet1\":\"Upload 12 formats from your browser, a URL, or FTP.\",\"register.bullet2\":\"Automatic encoding with an embeddable player on your own domain.\",\"register.bullet3\":\"Monetize with the ads manager or earn up to $45 per 10k views.\",\"register.success\":\"Account created successfully. Check your email to activate your profile.\",\"register.error\":\"Registration failed\",\"forgot.eyebrow\":\"Account recovery\",\"forgot.request.title\":\"Reset your password\",\"forgot.request.subtitle\":\"Enter the email linked to your account and we'll send you a secure reset link.\",\"forgot.request.emailLabel\":\"Email address\",\"forgot.request.emailPlaceholder\":\"you@example.com\",\"forgot.request.successToast\":\"Check your inbox for a secure reset link. The reset expires in 30 minutes.\",\"forgot.request.successInline\":\"Check your inbox for a reset link. It expires in 30 minutes.\",\"forgot.request.error\":\"Reset request failed\",\"forgot.request.submitting\":\"Sending…\",\"forgot.request.submit\":\"Send reset link\",\"forgot.reset.title\":\"Choose a new password\",\"forgot.reset.subtitle\":\"Enter and confirm your new password to secure your account.\",\"forgot.reset.newPasswordLabel\":\"New password\",\"forgot.reset.newPasswordPlaceholder\":\"Choose a strong password\",\"forgot.reset.confirmPasswordLabel\":\"Confirm password\",\"forgot.reset.confirmPasswordPlaceholder\":\"Repeat your new password\",\"forgot.reset.passwordMismatch\":\"Passwords do not match. Please re-enter them.\",\"forgot.reset.successToast\":\"Password updated. You can sign in with your new credentials.\",\"forgot.reset.successInline\":\"Password updated. Redirecting you to sign in…\",\"forgot.reset.error\":\"Password reset failed\",\"forgot.reset.submitting\":\"Updating…\",\"forgot.reset.submit\":\"Update password\",\"forgot.readyToSignIn\":\"Ready to sign in?\",\"forgot.rememberedPassword\":\"Remembered your password?\",\"forgot.signIn\":\"Sign in\",\"forgot.needAccount\":\"Need a Byse account?\",\"forgot.createAccount\":\"Create one now\",\"forgot.resetLinkExpired\":\"Reset link expired?\",\"forgot.requestNewLink\":\"Request a new one\",\"login.accountConfirmed\":\"Your account has been confirmed. You can sign in now.\",\"login.payoutConfirmed\":\"Your payout details are confirmed. Sign in to review your settings.\",\"login.confirmationFailed\":\"Account confirmation failed.\",\"login.success\":\"Signed in successfully.\",\"login.error\":\"Login failed\",\"login.accountDisabled\":\"Your account was disabled\",\"login.accountDisabledReason\":\"Your account was disabled. Reason: {{reason}}\",\"login.asideAria\":\"Highlights for creators\",\"login.asideTitle\":\"Your video library in one dashboard\",\"login.asideSubtitle\":\"Upload, encode, and stream from 26 locations while you track views and earnings in real time.\",\"login.bullet1\":\"Real-time views, watch time, and ad earnings.\",\"login.bullet2\":\"Adaptive HLS streaming from 26 global locations.\",\"login.bullet3\":\"Withdraw from your wallet once you reach the payout threshold.\",\"login.eyebrow\":\"Welcome back\",\"login.title\":\"Sign in to Byse\",\"login.subtitle\":\"Pick up where you left off.\",\"login.usernameLabel\":\"Username\",\"login.usernamePlaceholder\":\"Enter your username\",\"login.passwordLabel\":\"Password\",\"login.passwordPlaceholder\":\"Enter your password\",\"login.keepSignedIn\":\"Keep me signed in\",\"login.forgotPassword\":\"Forgot your password?\",\"login.submitting\":\"Signing in…\",\"login.submit\":\"Sign in\",\"login.noAccount\":\"Don't have an account yet?\",\"login.createAccount\":\"Create one now\",\"login.otp.defaultMessage\":\"Enter the 6-digit code we sent to your email.\",\"login.otp.invalidCode\":\"Please enter the 6-digit code.\",\"login.otp.verificationFailed\":\"Verification failed\",\"login.otp.badge\":\"Check your email\",\"login.otp.title\":\"Enter the 6-digit code\",\"login.otp.submitting\":\"Verifying…\",\"login.otp.submit\":\"Verify code\",\"login.otp.back\":\"Back to sign in\",\"login.otp.validity\":\"Codes are valid for up to one hour.\",\"passwordStrength.empty\":\"Enter a password to check strength\",\"passwordStrength.weak\":\"Weak password\",\"passwordStrength.fair\":\"Fair password\",\"passwordStrength.good\":\"Good password\",\"passwordStrength.strong\":\"Strong password\",\"otp.groupAria\":\"One-time password input\",\"otp.digitAria\":\"Digit {{index}}\"},home:{\"hero.eyebrow\":\"Video hosting, delivery and monetization\",\"hero.title\":\"Host your videos. Reach viewers fast. Get paid.\",\"hero.lead\":\"Upload from your browser, a remote link, or FTP. We encode every file, stream it from 26 locations worldwide, and help you earn from ads and referrals.\",\"hero.ctaPrimary\":\"Create free account\",\"hero.ctaSecondary\":\"Read the API docs\",\"hero.trust\":\"26 global locations · RAID 1+0 storage · Payouts up to $45 per 10k views\",\"hero.mock.title\":\"Library\",\"hero.mock.player\":\"Now playing\",\"hero.mock.statViews\":\"Views today\",\"hero.mock.statEarnings\":\"Earnings\",\"hero.mock.statStorage\":\"Storage\",\"stats.pops.label\":\"Global delivery locations\",\"stats.formats.label\":\"Supported upload formats\",\"stats.storage.value\":\"RAID 1+0\",\"stats.storage.label\":\"Replicated, encrypted storage\",\"stats.payout.label\":\"Affiliate payout per 10k views\",\"features.heading\":\"Everything you need to run a video site\",\"features.subheading\":\"One dashboard for uploading, streaming, analytics, and revenue.\",\"features.dashboard.title\":\"Operations dashboard\",\"features.dashboard.desc\":\"Upload, organize, publish, and monetize your whole library from one place.\",\"features.upload.title\":\"Upload your way\",\"features.upload.desc\":\"Browser uploads, remote URL fetches, and FTP drops, across 12 video formats.\",\"features.streaming.title\":\"Adaptive streaming\",\"features.streaming.desc\":\"Every file is encoded automatically and plays smoothly on any device.\",\"features.cdn.title\":\"26-location CDN\",\"features.cdn.desc\":\"Viewers stream from the nearest edge for fast starts and fewer rebuffers.\",\"features.analytics.title\":\"Transparent analytics\",\"features.analytics.desc\":\"Track views, watch time, ad earnings, and stream health in real time.\",\"features.storage.title\":\"Redundant storage\",\"features.storage.desc\":\"Multiple clusters with RAID 1+0, encrypted copies, and automated integrity checks.\",\"features.api.title\":\"Full REST API\",\"features.api.desc\":\"Automate uploads, playback, and account management with API keys and webhooks.\",\"features.domains.title\":\"Your own domain\",\"features.domains.desc\":\"Serve videos and embeds from your own branded hostname.\",\"features.ads.title\":\"Built-in ads manager\",\"features.ads.desc\":\"Run mid-rolls and sponsorships or paste your own ad code, and track earnings per file.\",\"steps.heading\":\"From upload to payout in three steps\",\"steps.subheading\":\"No setup calls and no integrations required.\",\"steps.one.title\":\"Upload\",\"steps.one.desc\":\"Add files from your browser, a remote link, or over FTP.\",\"steps.two.title\":\"Stream\",\"steps.two.desc\":\"We encode each file and deliver it from 26 locations worldwide.\",\"steps.three.title\":\"Earn\",\"steps.three.desc\":\"Turn on ads or join the affiliate program, then withdraw from your wallet.\",\"earn.eyebrow\":\"Monetization\",\"earn.title\":\"Two ways to make money from your videos\",\"earn.adsTitle\":\"Ads manager\",\"earn.adsDesc\":\"Place mid-rolls and sponsorships, or paste your own ad code, and see earnings per file.\",\"earn.affiliateTitle\":\"Affiliate program\",\"earn.affiliateDesc\":\"Refer creators and earn up to $45 for every 10,000 views they generate.\",\"earn.cta\":\"See premium plans\",\"included.heading\":\"Included with every account\",\"included.subheading\":\"No add-ons or extra fees for the basics.\",\"included.subtitles\":\"Subtitle manager\",\"included.posters\":\"Custom posters and thumbnails\",\"included.remote\":\"Remote and FTP upload\",\"included.embed\":\"Embeddable player\",\"included.folders\":\"Shared folders\",\"included.security\":\"Two-factor authentication\",\"included.devices\":\"Trusted device control\",\"included.dmca\":\"DMCA management tools\",\"included.wallet\":\"Wallet and payouts\",\"faq.heading\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"faq.q1\":\"What video formats can I upload?\",\"faq.a1\":\"MP4, MKV, AVI, WEBM, MOV, FLV, WMV, 3GP, TS, MPG, MPEG, and VOB. Every file is encoded for streaming automatically.\",\"faq.q2\":\"How do I get paid?\",\"faq.a2\":\"Earn through the built-in ads manager or the affiliate program, then withdraw your balance from the wallet once you reach the payout threshold.\",\"faq.q3\":\"Can I use my own domain?\",\"faq.a3\":\"Yes. Connect a custom domain and serve your videos and embeds from your own branded hostname.\",\"faq.q4\":\"Is there an API?\",\"faq.a4\":\"Yes. A full REST API with webhooks lets you automate uploads, playback, and account management.\",\"faq.q5\":\"How is my content stored?\",\"faq.a5\":\"Across multiple storage clusters with RAID 1+0 redundancy, encrypted copies, and automated integrity checks.\",\"final.title\":\"Start hosting on Byse today\",\"final.subtitle\":\"Create a free account and upload your first video in minutes.\",\"final.ctaPrimary\":\"Create free account\",\"final.ctaSecondary\":\"Contact us\"},pages:{\"servers.hero.eyebrow\":\"Byse infrastructure\",\"servers.hero.titleLead\":\"Servers that feel\",\"servers.hero.titleAccent\":\"effortless\",\"servers.hero.lead\":\"Dedicated machines and VPS on Linux or Windows. Configure it, watch the price update, and deploy. NVMe storage and DDoS protection come standard.\",\"servers.hero.ctaConfigure\":\"Configure a server\",\"servers.hero.ctaFaq\":\"Questions\",\"servers.hero.statusOk\":\"All systems operational\",\"servers.hero.uptime\":\"uptime\",\"servers.hero.regions\":\"regions\",\"servers.cfg.title\":\"Build your server\",\"servers.cfg.sub\":\"Pick a type, size it, choose where it lives. The price updates as you go.\",\"servers.cfg.type\":\"Type\",\"servers.cfg.size\":\"Plan\",\"servers.cfg.mo\":\"mo\",\"servers.cfg.upgrades\":\"Upgrades · optional\",\"servers.cfg.addRam\":\"Memory\",\"servers.cfg.addRamHint\":\"+$20 per 32 GB · up to 512 GB\",\"servers.cfg.addUplink\":\"Uplink\",\"servers.cfg.addUplinkHint\":\"+$40 per Gbps · up to 25 Gbps\",\"servers.cfg.addIp\":\"Extra IPv4\",\"servers.cfg.addIpHint\":\"+$3 per address\",\"servers.cfg.os\":\"Operating system\",\"servers.cfg.region\":\"Region\",\"servers.cfg.billedMonthly\":\"Billed monthly · cancel anytime\",\"servers.cfg.sumType\":\"Type\",\"servers.cfg.sumPlan\":\"Plan\",\"servers.cfg.sumStorage\":\"Storage\",\"servers.cfg.sumUplink\":\"Uplink\",\"servers.cfg.sumIps\":\"IPv4\",\"servers.cfg.sumNetwork\":\"Network\",\"servers.cfg.sumOs\":\"OS\",\"servers.cfg.sumRegion\":\"Region\",\"servers.cfg.comingSoon\":\"Coming soon\",\"servers.cfg.comingSoonNote\":\"Online ordering opens soon\",\"servers.bento.title\":\"What comes with it\",\"servers.bento.ddosTitle\":\"DDoS protection on every IP\",\"servers.bento.ddosDesc\":\"Always-on filtering absorbs attacks at the edge so your services stay online.\",\"servers.bento.nvmeTitle\":\"NVMe everywhere\",\"servers.bento.nvmeDesc\":\"Fast SSD storage, no spinning rust.\",\"servers.bento.deployTitle\":\"Minutes to live\",\"servers.bento.deployDesc\":\"VPS boots in minutes; dedicated ships same day.\",\"servers.bento.rootTitle\":\"Full control\",\"servers.bento.rootDesc\":\"Root on Linux, Administrator on Windows.\",\"servers.bento.networkTitle\":\"Global backbone\",\"servers.bento.networkDesc\":\"Low-latency network across four regions.\",\"servers.bento.supportTitle\":\"Engineers on call, 24/7\",\"servers.bento.supportDesc\":\"Real people answer your tickets at any hour — setup, migrations or a stubborn config.\",\"servers.loc.title\":\"Deploy close to your users\",\"servers.loc.sub\":\"Four regions on a low-latency backbone, with more on the way.\",\"servers.faq.title\":\"Good to know\",\"servers.faq.q1q\":\"Dedicated server or VPS — which do I need?\",\"servers.faq.q1a\":\"A dedicated server is a whole physical machine reserved for you. A VPS is an isolated virtual machine that shares hardware — cheaper, and live in minutes.\",\"servers.faq.q2q\":\"Can I run Windows?\",\"servers.faq.q2a\":\"Yes. Pick VPS Windows for a licensed Windows Server with RDP, or run Windows on a dedicated machine.\",\"servers.faq.q3q\":\"How fast is it ready?\",\"servers.faq.q3a\":\"VPS plans are provisioned automatically within minutes. Dedicated servers are usually ready the same day.\",\"servers.faq.q4q\":\"Can I upgrade a dedicated server later?\",\"servers.faq.q4a\":\"You can add RAM, uplink and extra IPs on a dedicated machine — set them when you order or open a ticket any time.\",\"servers.cta.title\":\"Spin up your first server today\",\"servers.cta.button\":\"Start configuring\",\"servers.dash.title\":\"Servers\",\"servers.dash.sub\":\"Deploy and manage your dedicated servers and VPS.\",\"servers.dash.comingSoon\":\"Coming soon\",\"servers.dash.statActive\":\"Active servers\",\"servers.dash.statSpend\":\"Monthly spend\",\"servers.dash.statOk\":\"Operational\",\"servers.dash.statHealth\":\"Fleet status\",\"servers.dash.yours\":\"Your servers\",\"servers.dash.tabActive\":\"Active\",\"servers.dash.tabAll\":\"All\",\"servers.dash.emptyTitle\":\"No servers yet\",\"servers.dash.emptyBody\":\"Browse the plans now — online ordering opens soon.\",\"servers.dash.emptyCta\":\"Browse plans\",\"servers.dash.quickTitle\":\"Quick deploy\",\"servers.dash.from\":\"from\",\"servers.dash.mo\":\"mo\",\"servers.dash.onRequest\":\"On request\",\"servers.dash.help\":\"Need help choosing a configuration?\",\"servers.dash.helpLink\":\"Open a support ticket\",\"reportAbuse.errors.invalidUrls\":\"Some of the links aren't valid web addresses. Add one full link per line.\",\"security.credentialsTitle\":\"Email & password\",\"security.emailLabel\":\"Email\",\"security.passwordLabel\":\"Password\",\"security.cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"security.pendingBadge\":\"Pending confirmation\",\"security.notSet\":\"Not set\",\"security.credentialsNote\":\"Email and password changes are confirmed from your current inbox before they take effect.\",\"security.changeEmailTitle\":\"Change email\",\"security.changePasswordTitle\":\"Change password\",\"security.newEmailLabel\":\"New email\",\"security.newPasswordLabel\":\"New password\",\"security.confirmPasswordLabel\":\"Confirm new password\",\"security.currentPasswordLabel\":\"Current password\",\"security.confirmationTarget\":\"We'll send a confirmation link to {{email}}.\",\"security.sendConfirmation\":\"Send confirmation link\",\"security.sending\":\"Sending…\",\"security.pendingEmailChange\":\"Waiting for you to confirm the move to {{email}}.\",\"security.pendingPasswordChange\":\"Waiting for you to confirm your new password.\",\"security.noAccountEmail\":\"Add an account email before changing your email or password.\",\"security.emailInvalid\":\"Enter a valid email address.\",\"security.sameEmail\":\"That's already your email address.\",\"security.passwordLength\":\"Use between 4 and 32 characters.\",\"security.passwordMismatch\":\"The passwords don't match.\",\"security.currentPasswordRequired\":\"Enter your current password.\",\"security.emailConfirmationSent\":\"Check your current inbox to confirm the new email.\",\"security.passwordConfirmationSent\":\"Check your inbox to confirm the new password.\",\"security.credentialUpdateError\":\"We couldn't start that change. Please try again.\",\"confirmEmailChange.eyebrow\":\"Security check\",\"confirmEmailChange.loadingTitle\":\"Confirming email change\",\"confirmEmailChange.loadingDescription\":\"We're verifying your request to update your email. This only takes a moment.\",\"confirmEmailChange.successTitle\":\"Email updated\",\"confirmEmailChange.successDescription\":\"Your account email has been changed.\",\"confirmEmailChange.failed\":\"Email change failed\",\"confirmEmailChange.errorDescription\":\"We couldn't verify this request.\",\"confirmEmailChange.missingDetails\":\"Missing confirmation details. Please use the link from your email.\",\"confirmEmailChange.updatedToast\":\"Email address updated.\",\"confirmEmailChange.inProgress\":\"Email confirmation is in progress.\",\"confirmEmailChange.requestNewLink\":\"Please start the change again from your security settings.\",\"confirmEmailChange.keepTabOpen\":\"We're applying your email change. Please keep this tab open.\",\"confirmEmailChange.redirectHint\":\"We'll take you to your security settings in a moment.\",\"confirmEmailChange.genericError\":\"Something went wrong while confirming this change.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.eyebrow\":\"Security check\",\"confirmPasswordChange.loadingTitle\":\"Confirming password change\",\"confirmPasswordChange.loadingDescription\":\"We're verifying your request to update your password. This only takes a moment.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.successTitle\":\"Password updated\",\"confirmPasswordChange.successDescription\":\"Your account password has been changed.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.failed\":\"Password change failed\",\"confirmPasswordChange.errorDescription\":\"We couldn't verify this request.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.missingDetails\":\"Missing confirmation details. Please use the link from your email.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.updatedToast\":\"Password updated.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.inProgress\":\"Password confirmation is in progress.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.requestNewLink\":\"Please start the change again from your security settings.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.keepTabOpen\":\"We're applying your password change. Please keep this tab open.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.redirectHint\":\"We'll take you to your security settings in a moment.\",\"confirmPasswordChange.genericError\":\"Something went wrong while confirming this change.\",\"reportAbuse.errors.tooManyUrls\":\"You can report up to {{max}} links at once.\",\"formCaptcha.verifying\":\"Verifying you're human…\",\"formCaptcha.verified\":\"Verified — thanks!\",\"formCaptcha.failed\":\"Couldn't verify automatically.\",\"formCaptcha.retry\":\"Try again\",\"formCaptcha.required\":\"Please complete the human check first.\",\"reportAbuse.eyebrow\":\"Trust & safety\",\"reportAbuse.title\":\"Report abuse\",\"reportAbuse.description\":\"Found content on Byse that breaks the law or our terms? Tell us what you saw and we'll review it. You don't need an account to file a report.\",\"reportAbuse.highlights.review\":\"Every report is reviewed by our trust & safety team.\",\"reportAbuse.highlights.confirmation\":\"You'll get an email with a reference number right away.\",\"reportAbuse.highlights.copyright\":\"Copyright owners can file a formal DMCA notice.\",\"reportAbuse.copyrightHint\":\"Reporting a copyright issue?\",\"reportAbuse.copyrightLink\":\"Use the copyright form\",\"reportAbuse.form.title\":\"Submit a report\",\"reportAbuse.form.subtitle\":\"Fields marked with * are required.\",\"reportAbuse.sections.about\":\"What are you reporting?\",\"reportAbuse.sections.contact\":\"Your contact details\",\"reportAbuse.sections.details\":\"Details\",\"reportAbuse.sections.copyright\":\"Copyright declarations\",\"reportAbuse.fields.type\":\"Type of abuse\",\"reportAbuse.fields.typePlaceholder\":\"Select a category\",\"reportAbuse.fields.name\":\"Your name\",\"reportAbuse.fields.email\":\"Email\",\"reportAbuse.fields.company\":\"Company or organization\",\"reportAbuse.fields.phone\":\"Phone\",\"reportAbuse.fields.country\":\"Country\",\"reportAbuse.fields.address\":\"Address\",\"reportAbuse.fields.urls\":\"Reported links\",\"reportAbuse.fields.description\":\"What's wrong?\",\"reportAbuse.fields.originalWork\":\"The original work\",\"reportAbuse.fields.signature\":\"Electronic signature\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.name\":\"Jane Doe\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.email\":\"you@example.com\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.optional\":\"Optional\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.country\":\"e.g. United States\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.urls\":\"https://byse.sx/d/abc123\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.description\":\"Tell us what's wrong and how we can confirm it.\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.originalWork\":\"Where the original can be found, registration details, links.\",\"reportAbuse.placeholders.signature\":\"Type your full legal name\",\"reportAbuse.hints.contact\":\"We only use your details to handle this report.\",\"reportAbuse.hints.urls\":\"One link per line.\",\"reportAbuse.types.copyright\":\"Copyright infringement (DMCA)\",\"reportAbuse.types.trademark\":\"Trademark\",\"reportAbuse.types.malware\":\"Malware\",\"reportAbuse.types.phishing\":\"Phishing\",\"reportAbuse.types.csam\":\"Child sexual abuse material\",\"reportAbuse.types.privacy\":\"Privacy or personal information\",\"reportAbuse.types.violence\":\"Threats or violence\",\"reportAbuse.types.spam\":\"Spam or network abuse\",\"reportAbuse.types.other\":\"Something else\",\"reportAbuse.declarations.rightsOwner\":\"I am the copyright owner or authorized to act for them.\",\"reportAbuse.declarations.goodFaith\":\"I believe in good faith that this use is not authorized by the owner, its agent, or the law.\",\"reportAbuse.declarations.accuracy\":\"The information here is accurate, and I declare under penalty of perjury that I'm authorized to act.\",\"reportAbuse.copyrightNotice\":\"A copyright report is a legal notice. False claims can carry legal consequences.\",\"reportAbuse.submit\":\"Submit report\",\"reportAbuse.submitting\":\"Submitting…\",\"reportAbuse.success.title\":\"Report received\",\"reportAbuse.success.body\":\"Thanks for flagging this. Our team will take it from here and only reach out if we need more details.\",\"reportAbuse.success.reference\":\"Your reference: {{reference}}\",\"reportAbuse.success.emailNote\":\"We sent a confirmation to {{email}}.\",\"reportAbuse.success.another\":\"Submit another report\",\"reportAbuse.errors.generic\":\"We couldn't submit your report. Please try again.\",\"reportAbuse.errors.selectType\":\"Please choose what you're reporting.\",\"assistant.confirmPrompt\":\"I couldn't find a sure answer. Want me to open a support ticket so the team can help?\",\"assistant.confirmYes\":\"Yes, open a ticket\",\"assistant.confirmNo\":\"No, thanks\",\"assistant.confirmDeclined\":\"No problem. Ask me anything else!\",\"assistant.refused\":\"I can only help with using Byse. I can't run commands or share account or system details — ask me about a feature instead.\",\"assistant.launcher\":\"Need help?\",\"assistant.open\":\"Open the assistant\",\"assistant.title\":\"Byse Assistant\",\"assistant.subtitle\":\"Replies in this chat\",\"assistant.close\":\"Close the assistant\",\"assistant.greeting\":\"Hi! I can help with uploads, your account, earnings and storage. What do you need?\",\"assistant.placeholder\":\"Type your question…\",\"assistant.inputLabel\":\"Your question\",\"assistant.send\":\"Send\",\"assistant.relatedLabel\":\"Related\",\"assistant.escalated\":\"I'm not sure about that one, so I opened ticket #{{id}} for you. The team will reply soon.\",\"assistant.escalatedFailed\":\"I couldn't answer that. Please open a support ticket and we'll help.\",\"assistant.error\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"assistant.typing\":\"The assistant is typing\",\"assistant.ticketLabel\":\"Ticket #{{id}}\",\"assistant.viewTicket\":\"Open ticket #{{id}}\",\"assistant.viewTicketHint\":\"Tap to open\",\"assistant.quick.upload\":\"Upload a video\",\"assistant.quick.payout\":\"Get paid\",\"assistant.quick.premium\":\"Premium\",\"assistant.quick.storage\":\"More storage\",\"assistant.name\":\"Mia\",\"assistant.greetingAlt\":\"Hey, I'm Mia 👋 Ask me anything about uploads, your account, earnings or storage.\",\"assistant.social.greeting\":\"Hi there! 👋 What can I help you with?\",\"assistant.social.thanks\":\"Anytime — happy to help! Anything else I can do?\",\"assistant.social.goodbye\":\"Take care! I'm right here whenever you need a hand.\",\"assistant.social.smalltalk\":\"Doing great, thanks for asking! What can I help you with today?\",\"assistant.social.identity\":\"I'm Mia, the Byse assistant — not a human agent, but I'll do my best to help, and I can pass you to the team whenever you like.\",\"assistant.clarifyPrompt\":\"I want to point you to the right thing — which of these did you mean?\",\"captcha.title\":\"Security check\",\"captcha.checking\":\"Loading your player…\",\"captcha.fallbackNotice\":\"Couldn't verify automatically — tap the matching icon.\",\"captcha.prompt.shape\":\"Please click the {{kw}}\",\"captcha.prompt.color\":\"Please click the {{kw}} icon\",\"captcha.prompt.size\":\"Please click the {{kw}} icon\",\"captcha.colors.red\":\"red\",\"captcha.colors.orange\":\"orange\",\"captcha.colors.green\":\"green\",\"captcha.colors.blue\":\"blue\",\"captcha.colors.purple\":\"purple\",\"captcha.colors.pink\":\"pink\",\"captcha.sizes.largest\":\"largest\",\"captcha.sizes.smallest\":\"smallest\",\"captcha.play\":\"Play video\",\"captcha.gateHint\":\"Click play button in order to verify you're a human\",\"captcha.loading\":\"Loading…\",\"captcha.loadError\":\"Couldn't load the check. Try again.\",\"captcha.verifyError\":\"Something went wrong. Try again.\",\"captcha.wrongSelection\":\"Wrong pick — {{count}} try left.\",\"captcha.wrongSelection_other\":\"Wrong pick — {{count}} tries left.\",\"captcha.expired\":\"New check — please try again.\",\"captcha.refresh\":\"New images\",\"captcha.tileLabel\":\"Image {{index}}\",\"captcha.attemptsLeft\":\"{{count}} try left\",\"captcha.attemptsLeft_other\":\"{{count}} tries left\",\"captcha.shapes.circle\":\"circle\",\"captcha.shapes.square\":\"square\",\"captcha.shapes.triangle\":\"triangle\",\"captcha.shapes.diamond\":\"diamond\",\"captcha.shapes.star\":\"star\",\"captcha.shapes.hexagon\":\"hexagon\",\"captcha.shapes.heart\":\"heart\",\"captcha.shapes.cross\":\"cross\",\"notFound.title\":\"Page not found\",\"notFound.description\":\"The page you are looking for doesn't exist or may have moved.\",\"notFound.backHome\":\"Back to homepage\",\"notFound.contact\":\"Contact support\",\"logout.title\":\"Signing you out\",\"logout.error\":\"Failed to log out\",\"logout.errorWithReason\":\"We could not end your session: {{error}}\",\"logout.progress\":\"We are ending your session. You will be redirected shortly.\",\"confirmPayout.missingDetails\":\"Missing confirmation details. Please use the link from your email.\",\"confirmPayout.updatedToast\":\"Payout details updated.\",\"confirmPayout.failed\":\"Payout confirmation failed\",\"confirmPayout.successTitle\":\"Payout change confirmed\",\"confirmPayout.loadingTitle\":\"Confirming payout change\",\"confirmPayout.errorDescription\":\"We could not verify this request.\",\"confirmPayout.successDescription\":\"Your payout details have been updated successfully.\",\"confirmPayout.loadingDescription\":\"We are validating your request to update payout details. This only takes a moment.\",\"confirmPayout.redirectHintUser\":\"You will be redirected to your account settings once this is complete.\",\"confirmPayout.redirectHintGuest\":\"After confirmation we will redirect you to sign in so you can review your settings.\",\"confirmPayout.successHintUser\":\"Redirecting you to account settings to review the updated payout details.\",\"confirmPayout.successHintGuest\":\"Redirecting you to sign in so you can review your payout settings.\",\"confirmPayout.eyebrow\":\"Security check\",\"confirmPayout.genericError\":\"Something went wrong while confirming this change.\",\"confirmPayout.requestNewLink\":\"Please request a new confirmation link from your settings.\",\"confirmPayout.inProgress\":\"Payout confirmation is in progress.\",\"confirmPayout.keepTabOpen\":\"We are applying your payout changes. Please keep this tab open.\",\"staticOperation.dashboardDescription\":\"Check premium service status and current offers without leaving the dashboard.\",\"staticOperation.publicDescription\":\"Customise the content and embedded widgets shown on this page.\",\"staticOperation.dashboardLoading\":\"Loading premium status…\",\"staticOperation.publicLoading\":\"Loading latest content…\",\"staticOperation.dashboardRefreshing\":\"Refreshing premium status…\",\"staticOperation.publicRefreshing\":\"Refreshing content…\",\"staticOperation.dashboardSuccess\":\"Premium service is online.\",\"staticOperation.publicSuccess\":\"Page loaded successfully.\",\"contact.presetSalesInquiry\":\"Premium sales inquiry\",\"contact.presetSupportRequest\":\"Support request\",\"contact.presetSlackInvite\":\"Slack Connect invitation\",\"contact.presetIncidentEscalation\":\"Incident escalation\",\"contact.messageNotSent\":\"Message not sent\",\"contact.eyebrow\":\"Support\",\"contact.title\":\"Contact the Byse team\",\"contact.subtitle\":\"From onboarding to CDN migrations, our specialists are ready to help.\",\"contact.supportPortal\":\"Support portal\",\"contact.submitRequest\":\"Submit a request\",\"contact.priorityHotline\":\"Support tickets\",\"contact.slackConnect\":\"Sales and partnerships\",\"contact.askInvite\":\"Contact sales\",\"contact.openTicket\":\"Open a ticket\",\"contact.responseTargets\":\"Response targets\",\"contact.globalAverage\":\"Global average\",\"contact.panelCopy\":\"Our engineers monitor the platform around the clock, so urgent issues are handled any time of day.\",\"contact.formTitle\":\"Send us a message\",\"contact.formSubtitle\":\"Share as much detail as possible so we can route your request to the right team.\",\"contact.name\":\"Name\",\"contact.namePlaceholder\":\"Your name\",\"contact.email\":\"Email\",\"contact.emailPlaceholder\":\"you@example.com\",\"contact.subject\":\"Subject\",\"contact.subjectPlaceholder\":\"How can we help?\",\"contact.message\":\"Message\",\"contact.messagePlaceholder\":\"Tell us more\",\"contact.sending\":\"Sending…\",\"contact.sendMessage\":\"Send message\",\"contact.needImmediateAssistance\":\"Need immediate assistance?\",\"contact.supportCopy\":\"Escalate an incident or browse the API documentation.\",\"contact.escalateIncident\":\"Escalate an incident\",\"contact.exploreDocs\":\"Explore developer docs\",\"contact.highlights.coverage.title\":\"Global support coverage\",\"contact.highlights.coverage.description\":\"Specialists across North America, Europe, and Asia-Pacific keep response times under 12 hours.\",\"contact.highlights.transparency.title\":\"Status transparency\",\"contact.highlights.transparency.description\":\"Real-time dashboards show platform health and uptime.\",\"contact.highlights.migration.title\":\"Migration support\",\"contact.highlights.migration.description\":\"Moving from another host? Our engineers handle the entire cutover for you.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.missingDetails\":\"Missing confirmation details. Please use the link from your email.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.confirmedToast\":\"Trusted device confirmed.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.failed\":\"Device confirmation failed\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.successTitle\":\"Trusted device confirmed\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.loadingTitle\":\"Confirming trusted device\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.errorDescription\":\"We could not verify this device trust request.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.successDescription\":\"Your device has been trusted successfully.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.loadingDescription\":\"We are validating your device trust request. This only takes a moment.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.redirectHintUser\":\"You will be redirected to your account settings once this is complete.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.redirectHintGuest\":\"After confirmation we will redirect you to sign in so you can review your settings.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.successHintUser\":\"Redirecting you to account settings to review your trusted devices.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.successHintGuest\":\"Redirecting you to sign in so you can review your trusted devices.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.eyebrow\":\"Security check\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.genericError\":\"Something went wrong while confirming this device.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.requestNewLink\":\"Please request a new confirmation link from your settings.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.inProgress\":\"Device confirmation is in progress.\",\"confirmTrustedDevice.keepTabOpen\":\"We are applying your device trust request. Please keep this tab open.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.missingDetails\":\"Missing confirmation details. Please use the link from your email.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.removedToast\":\"Trusted device removed successfully.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.removedShort\":\"Trusted device removed.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.failed\":\"Device removal failed\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.successTitle\":\"Trusted device removed\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.loadingTitle\":\"Confirming removal\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.errorDescription\":\"We could not verify this device removal request.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.successDescription\":\"Your device has been removed successfully.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.loadingDescription\":\"We are validating your device removal request. This only takes a moment.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.redirectHintUser\":\"You will be redirected to your account settings once this is complete.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.redirectHintGuest\":\"After confirmation we will redirect you to sign in so you can review your settings.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.successHintUser\":\"Redirecting you to account settings to review your trusted devices.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.successHintGuest\":\"Redirecting you to sign in so you can review your trusted devices.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.eyebrow\":\"Security check\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.genericError\":\"Something went wrong while confirming this removal.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.requestNewLink\":\"Please request a new removal link from your settings.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.inProgress\":\"Device removal is in progress.\",\"confirmTrustedDeviceRemoval.keepTabOpen\":\"We are applying your device removal request. Please keep this tab open.\",\"affiliate.tableTitle\":\"Country CPM table\",\"affiliate.tableSubtitle\":\"Search for a country to see the latest CPM per 1,000 impressions.\",\"affiliate.updatedAt\":\"Updated {{date}}\",\"affiliate.windowDays\":\"Based on the last {{count}} days of impressions.\",\"affiliate.searchLabel\":\"Search countries\",\"affiliate.searchPlaceholder\":\"Search by country name or code\",\"affiliate.loading\":\"Loading country rates…\",\"affiliate.refreshing\":\"Refreshing country rates…\",\"affiliate.columnCountry\":\"Country\",\"affiliate.columnCpm\":\"CPM\",\"affiliate.columnImpressions\":\"Impressions\",\"affiliate.errorEmpty\":\"Country CPM data is temporarily unavailable.\",\"affiliate.noData\":\"No country data available yet.\",\"affiliate.rulesTitle\":\"Payout rules\",\"affiliate.rulesSubtitle\":\"We want payouts to be transparent, predictable, and fair for everyone.\",\"affiliate.rule1\":\"We pay by impressions, not by raw views. Every 1,000 paid impressions in a country earns the CPM shown in the table.\",\"affiliate.rule2\":\"Impressions blocked by ad blockers don't count toward payouts.\",\"affiliate.rule3\":\"We don't pay out on traffic we identify as fraudulent.\",\"affiliate.rule4\":\"Payouts are forfeited if you breach our Terms of Service.\",\"affiliate.heroEyebrow\":\"Affiliate program\",\"affiliate.heroTitle\":\"Earn up to $45 for every 10,000 views\",\"affiliate.heroLead\":\"Share your referral link. When the creators you refer upload videos and those videos get watched, you earn a share of the ad revenue.\",\"affiliate.heroCtaPrimary\":\"Create free account\",\"affiliate.heroCtaSecondary\":\"See CPM rates\",\"affiliate.statPayoutValue\":\"$45\",\"affiliate.statPayoutLabel\":\"Top payout per 10k views\",\"affiliate.statCountriesValue\":\"Worldwide\",\"affiliate.statCountriesLabel\":\"Country-based CPM rates\",\"affiliate.statPayoutsValue\":\"Wallet\",\"affiliate.statPayoutsLabel\":\"Withdraw your earnings any time\",\"affiliate.stepsTitle\":\"How the program works\",\"affiliate.stepsSubtitle\":\"No approval process and no minimum following required.\",\"affiliate.step1Title\":\"Share your link\",\"affiliate.step1Desc\":\"Grab your unique referral link from the dashboard and share it with other creators.\",\"affiliate.step2Title\":\"They upload and stream\",\"affiliate.step2Desc\":\"The people you refer host their videos on Byse and reach viewers worldwide.\",\"affiliate.step3Title\":\"You get paid\",\"affiliate.step3Desc\":\"Earn a share of revenue on every 10,000 paid impressions, withdrawn from your wallet.\",\"affiliate.ratesTitle\":\"CPM rates by country\",\"affiliate.ctaTitle\":\"Start earning with Byse\",\"affiliate.ctaSubtitle\":\"Create a free account, then find your referral link in the affiliate dashboard.\",\"affiliate.ctaButton\":\"Create free account\",\"copyrightPolicy.title\":\"Copyright Policy\",\"copyrightPolicy.description\":\"Review the responsibilities that apply when you upload or distribute content on Byse.\",\"copyrightPolicy.lastUpdated\":\"March 18, 2024\",\"copyrightPolicy.contactLabel\":\"Contact us\",\"copyrightPolicy.badge\":\"Compliance\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.title\":\"§1 Rules for uploading content to the Platform\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.intro\":\"By submitting content to the Platform, each User declares that they:\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.declaration1\":\"Hold full rights to manage the uploaded content or possess the necessary licences to distribute it.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.declaration2\":\"Obtained consent from any individuals appearing in the content whenever such consent is required for publication.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.declaration3\":\"Provide accurate information that is not intended to mislead.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.documentation\":\"Users must present documentation confirming the above whenever requested by the Service Provider.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.licenseGrant\":\"By posting content protected by intellectual property rights, Users grant the Service Provider a non-exclusive, free, worldwide licence, with the right to sub-license, to use the content. The licence covers recording, reproduction, distribution, public display, making the content available online, translation, and the creation of derivative works. It remains valid until the content or account is removed.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.responsibility\":\"Users are solely responsible for any infringements arising from the content they upload.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.removalPolicy\":\"The Service Provider may remove or block content that violates the law or morality. Access may be limited temporarily or permanently.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.removalWhen\":\"The Service Provider may delete or block content when:\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.reason1\":\"Automated filters identify a potential copyright infringement.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.reason2\":\"Official notifications indicate the content violates third-party rights.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.reason3\":\"Credible notifications accompanied by supporting evidence allege an infringement.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.credibleNotice\":\"Credible notifications must contain information or evidence that the content is unlawful. The Service Provider removes or blocks reported material immediately and no later than within three days of receipt.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.restoration\":\"Users may request restoration of material by submitting evidence that it does not infringe third-party rights or violate decency.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.indemnification\":\"Users indemnify the Service Provider against third-party claims related to uploaded content, covering awarded amounts, court costs, mediation fees, and legal expenses.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.liabilityDisclaimer\":\"The Service Provider is not liable for damages or lost profits stemming from content removals or blocks initiated by official or credible notifications, including those triggered by automated filters.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.reporting\":\"Reports about content that may infringe rights or public decency are handled exclusively through our <reportLink>Report abuse form</reportLink>. We respond immediately and within three days at the latest.\",\"copyrightPolicy.sections.uploading.advanceNotice\":\"Users intending to publish material listed in §4.9 of the Terms must notify the Service Provider at least 24 hours in advance. Failure to notify results in liability for any related damages. Such materials remain subject to the age restrictions described in §4.9.\",\"terms.title\":\"Terms of Service\",\"terms.description\":\"Understand the rules that govern your use of the Byse platform—from account management to monetisation and dispute resolution.\",\"terms.lastUpdated\":\"March 18, 2024\",\"terms.contactLabel\":\"Contact us\",\"terms.badge\":\"Policies\",\"terms.sections.general.title\":\"§1 General provisions\",\"terms.sections.general.body1\":\"These Terms and Conditions specify the principles for using the byse.com platform and the rules for acquiring information and publishing content across the service.\",\"terms.sections.general.body2\":\"byse.com is a platform for posting, viewing, downloading, and sharing content with audiences chosen by a User. The platform is owned and operated by Video Hosting Services LLC, 13-15 Bolsunovska St., 8th floor, Kyiv, Ukraine 01014. For assistance, please use the <contactLink>contact page</contactLink>.\",\"terms.sections.general.body3\":\"Registering an account or otherwise using the service constitutes acceptance of these Terms and Conditions together with the accompanying Privacy Policy.\",\"terms.sections.general.intro\":\"The following definitions apply throughout this document:\",\"terms.sections.general.definition1\":\"Platform – the online platform operated in English via the Website.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition2\":\"Service Provider – Video Hosting Services LLC, acting as the operator of byse.com.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition3\":\"Website – https://byse.com and any subpages thereof.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition4\":\"Service – the full scope of digital services that enable access to byse.com, including posting, viewing, downloading and sharing content.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition5\":\"User – any entity using the Platform.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition6\":\"User Account – an individual account that stores personal data and provides access to the Platform’s functionalities.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition7\":\"Consumer – a natural person acting outside a professional activity as defined by the Polish Civil Code of 23 April 1964. Sole proprietors entering into non-professional contracts under their business scope are also treated as Consumers.\",\"terms.sections.general.definition8\":\"Terms and Conditions – this document together with the Privacy Policy, both available on the Website.\",\"terms.sections.general.body4\":\"Users may contact the Service Provider via the <contactLink>contact page</contactLink>.\",\"terms.sections.services.title\":\"§2 Services provided through the Platform\",\"terms.sections.services.body1\":\"The Service Provider offers digital services via distance contracts concluded with Users.\",\"terms.sections.services.body2\":\"There are no fees for accessing and using the Services.\",\"terms.sections.services.body3\":\"The Services include:\",\"terms.sections.services.item1\":\"Creating and maintaining User Accounts.\",\"terms.sections.services.item2\":\"Adding, editing, and deleting data.\",\"terms.sections.services.item3\":\"Downloading and viewing data.\",\"terms.sections.services.body4\":\"A services agreement is concluded once a User completes the registration process. Agreements are open-ended, and a User may terminate the agreement at any time in line with these Terms and Conditions.\",\"terms.sections.services.body5\":\"Registration is required to access the Services listed above.\",\"terms.sections.services.body6\":\"The Service Provider may modify or extend the scope of Services over time.\",\"terms.sections.registration.title\":\"§3 Registration at the Platform\",\"terms.sections.registration.body1\":\"Users register individual accounts to access Platform features.\",\"terms.sections.registration.body2\":\"Registration requires completing a form and providing data such as name, surname, e-mail, and password.\",\"terms.sections.registration.body3\":\"Only individuals authorised to represent the User may create or manage an account.\",\"terms.sections.registration.body4\":\"Providing false data or creating accounts via automated means is prohibited.\",\"terms.sections.registration.body5\":\"The Service Provider may withhold or suspend an account if there are reasonable doubts regarding the authenticity of the supplied information.\",\"terms.sections.registration.body6\":\"Account data must remain accurate. Users must promptly update any changes through the tools available on the Website.\",\"terms.sections.rules.title\":\"§4 General rules governing the use of the Platform\",\"terms.sections.rules.body1\":\"To use the Platform a User must:\",\"terms.sections.rules.item1\":\"Have an internet-connected device such as a computer, laptop, or mobile phone.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item2\":\"Have access to e-mail.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item3\":\"Use an up-to-date web browser.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item4\":\"Enable cookies in the browser.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body2\":\"Users must comply with applicable law and good practices.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body3\":\"Accounts may not be used to harm other Users, the Service Provider, or third parties.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body4\":\"Users agree to:\",\"terms.sections.rules.item5\":\"Use the Platform and its resources as intended.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item6\":\"Comply with Polish law.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item7\":\"Respect the rights and personal interests of other Users.\",\"terms.sections.rules.item8\":\"Refrain from actions that could harm other Users, the Service Provider, or third parties.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body5\":\"Users own the content they publish and bear sole responsibility for potential infringements.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body6\":\"Posting illegal, offensive, defamatory, hateful, or otherwise inappropriate material—including content that promotes piracy, distributes malicious code, or encourages discrimination—is strictly forbidden.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body7\":\"Users may view and download content posted by others for private use only under Article 23 of the Act of 4 February 1994 on Copyright and Related Rights. Any other use requires separate permission from the rights holder.\",\"terms.sections.rules.body8\":\"Accounts associated with unlawful or harmful content may be blocked or removed. The Service Provider may impose age restrictions on material involving dangerous activities, substances, erotic content, violence, or vulgar language.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.title\":\"§5 Rules for uploading content to the Platform\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body1\":\"By uploading content, the User confirms that they:\",\"terms.sections.uploading.item1\":\"Hold full rights to the content, including any necessary licences, or otherwise have the legal right to share it.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.item2\":\"Obtained consent from individuals whose image or likeness appears in the content.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.item3\":\"Provide accurate, non-misleading information.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body2\":\"The Service Provider may request documentation proving the above declarations. Users must comply promptly with such requests.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body3\":\"Users grant the Service Provider a non-exclusive, free, sub-licensable licence to use uploaded content worldwide for as long as it remains on the Platform. The licence covers recording, reproduction, distribution, public display, making the content available online, translation, and the creation of derivative works. The licence terminates when the content is removed or the account is deleted.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body4\":\"Users bear full responsibility for uploaded content and any resulting infringements.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body5\":\"The Service Provider may remove or block unlawful or inappropriate content, including when a filtering system, notification from authorities, or a credible third-party notice indicates a potential infringement.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body6\":\"Credible notifications must include evidence supporting the allegation. The Service Provider removes or blocks reported material immediately and no later than within three days of receiving a report.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body7\":\"Users may request restoration of blocked material by providing evidence that the content does not infringe third-party rights or violate decency.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body8\":\"If third-party claims arise from a User’s content, the User will indemnify the Service Provider, join related legal proceedings, and cover adjudicated amounts, court costs, mediation fees, and legal expenses.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body9\":\"The Service Provider is not liable for damages or lost profits related to removing or blocking reported material, including cases where automated filters identify an infringement.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body10\":\"Reports about infringing or indecent content are handled exclusively through our <reportLink>Report abuse form</reportLink>. The Service Provider responds without delay and within three days at the latest.\",\"terms.sections.uploading.body11\":\"Users intending to publish content described in §4.9 must notify the Service Provider 24 hours in advance. Failure to do so makes the User liable for resulting damages. Content published without such notice is not the responsibility of the Service Provider. These materials remain subject to the age restrictions outlined in §4.9.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.title\":\"§6 Settlements with the Users\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body1\":\"The Platform offers two monetisation programmes:\",\"terms.sections.settlements.item1\":\"<strong>Pay Per View:</strong> remuneration based on total views of content posted by the User.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.item2\":\"<strong>Affiliate Programme for Publishing Entities:</strong> remuneration based on views generated on the User’s website.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body2\":\"Participation requires successful registration and notification of intent to join the programme.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body3\":\"Compensation is calculated per 10,000 qualifying views.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body4\":\"At least 10% of a video must be watched for a view to count.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body5\":\"Blocking advertisements forfeits remuneration for those views.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body6\":\"Artificially inflating views, including via automated tools, is prohibited.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body7\":\"For security reasons, multiple views from the same IP address within 24 hours are limited to one or two counts, depending on the number of plays.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body8\":\"The minimum payout is USD 20. Payments are processed daily and issued within ninety days after the qualifying month.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body9\":\"Supported payout methods: BitCoin, PayPal, WebMoney, Payoneer.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.body10\":\"Rates per 10,000 views depend on the User’s registration country:\",\"terms.sections.settlements.rate1\":\"USD 35 – Australia, Germany, Norway, United States, United Kingdom.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.rate2\":\"USD 22 – Austria, Canada, Denmark, Finland, France.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.rate3\":\"USD 12 – Belgium, Ireland, Netherlands, New Zealand, Spain, Switzerland, Indonesia, Thailand, Greece, Ukraine, Hungary.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.rate4\":\"USD 8 – Brazil, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Czech Republic, Hong Kong, India, Italy, Japan, Mexico, Poland, Romania, Russia, Serbia, Slovakia, Vietnam, South Korea, Chile, Philippines.\",\"terms.sections.settlements.rate5\":\"USD 4.5 – All other countries.\",\"terms.sections.liability.title\":\"§7 Liability. Access to and use of the Platform\",\"terms.sections.liability.body1\":\"The Service Provider strives to maintain secure, uninterrupted access to the Platform but is not responsible for actions taken by Users or for User expectations beyond the Platform’s general purpose.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body2\":\"The Service Provider is not liable for:\",\"terms.sections.liability.item1\":\"User activities.\",\"terms.sections.liability.item2\":\"Accuracy or reliability of data provided by Users.\",\"terms.sections.liability.item3\":\"Temporary technical errors or defects in User-submitted data.\",\"terms.sections.liability.item4\":\"Quality, availability, or correctness of content obtained via the Platform.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body3\":\"The Service Provider is also not liable for damages or lost profits arising from inability to use the Platform, downtime, errors, unauthorised access, third-party interference, or account deletion—whether losses are direct or indirect.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body4\":\"The Service Provider is not responsible for damage caused by third parties using valid User credentials.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body5\":\"Interruptions caused by User hardware or software issues, internet outages, force majeure, or unauthorised third-party interference are outside the Service Provider’s liability.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body6\":\"Upon receiving notice of unauthorised access, the Service Provider immediately secures the collected data and regularly creates backups to minimise risk.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body7\":\"The Service Provider may change the Platform or Services to improve or modernise the experience, including altering functionalities.\",\"terms.sections.liability.body8\":\"Liability limitations toward Consumers apply only to the extent permitted by law.\",\"terms.sections.complaints.title\":\"§8 Complaints\",\"terms.sections.complaints.body1\":\"Users may report irregularities within 14 days of occurrence through the <contactLink>contact page</contactLink> with sufficient detail to identify and resolve the issue.\",\"terms.sections.complaints.body2\":\"Complaints are reviewed within 14 calendar days.\",\"terms.sections.complaints.body3\":\"In the event of serious technical faults the Service Provider may temporarily limit access to the Website, Platform, or Services.\",\"terms.sections.complaints.body4\":\"Users should report operational errors, comments, and Terms and Conditions violations to the Service Provider electronically.\",\"terms.sections.accountDeletion.title\":\"§9 Deletion of User Accounts\",\"terms.sections.accountDeletion.body1\":\"Users may delete their account at any time via the tools available on the Website.\",\"terms.sections.accountDeletion.body2\":\"Account removal occurs within 14 days of submitting the request.\",\"terms.sections.accountDeletion.body3\":\"If the Service Provider deletes an account, re-registration requires prior consent. Accounts created without consent may be removed.\",\"terms.sections.amendments.title\":\"§10 Amendments of the Terms and Conditions\",\"terms.sections.amendments.body1\":\"The Service Provider may amend the Terms for significant reasons, including legal changes, organisational adjustments, or modifications to how contracts are concluded and delivered. Existing orders and contracts remain unaffected. For active subscriptions, changes take effect at the end of the subscription period.\",\"terms.sections.amendments.body2\":\"Users are notified of amendments 14 days in advance via e-mail and an in-account notice. Lack of consent to the changes requires account deletion.\",\"terms.sections.amendments.body3\":\"If no action is taken within 14 days of notification, the changes are deemed accepted and become binding.\",\"terms.sections.personalData.title\":\"§11 Personal data protection\",\"terms.sections.personalData.body1\":\"User data is used solely for the stated purposes. The Service Provider does not share personal data with third parties unless it is required to deliver the Services or mandated by law.\",\"terms.sections.personalData.body2\":\"Further details are available in the Privacy Policy published on the Website.\",\"terms.sections.disputes.title\":\"§12 Non-judicial dispute resolution\",\"terms.sections.disputes.body1\":\"Consumers may seek alternative dispute resolution prior to court proceedings by contacting the following institutions:\",\"terms.sections.disputes.item1\":\"Permanent amicable consumer courts (Act on Trade Inspection of 15 December 2000) via motions to settle disputes.\",\"terms.sections.disputes.item2\":\"Voivodeship Trade Inspection Authorities for mediation proceedings.\",\"terms.sections.disputes.item3\":\"District or municipal consumer ombudsmen or consumer-rights organisations.\",\"terms.sections.disputes.body2\":\"Information on dispute resolution mechanisms is available from the Trade Inspection Authority, consumer ombudsmen, consumer-rights organisations, and the Office of Competition and Consumer Protection (UOKiK).\",\"terms.sections.disputes.body3\":\"EU consumers can use the Online Dispute Resolution platform at http://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr for cross-border cases.\",\"terms.sections.final.title\":\"§13 Final provisions\",\"terms.sections.final.body1\":\"Matters not covered herein are governed by Polish law. These Terms are interpreted accordingly without limiting any mandatory consumer rights in a User’s country of residence.\",\"terms.sections.final.body2\":\"Disputes between the Service Provider and non-consumer Users fall under the jurisdiction of courts competent for the Service Provider’s registered office. Disputes involving Consumers are handled by courts in the Consumer’s place of residence.\",\"tickets.status.closed\":\"Closed\",\"tickets.status.adminReply\":\"Admin Reply\",\"tickets.status.userReply\":\"User Reply\",\"tickets.status.open\":\"Open\",\"tickets.unknown\":\"Unknown\",\"tickets.createRequired\":\"Title and message are required.\",\"tickets.adminRepliedTicket\":\"Administrator replied to ticket #{{id}}.\",\"tickets.pageTitle\":\"Support\",\"tickets.pageSubtitle\":\"Track your conversations and follow updates.\",\"tickets.recentTitle\":\"Recent tickets\",\"tickets.recentSubtitle\":\"Your latest support replies and updates.\",\"tickets.totalCount\":\"{{count}} total\",\"tickets.hideForm\":\"Hide form\",\"tickets.createTicket\":\"Create ticket\",\"tickets.refreshing\":\"Refreshing…\",\"tickets.refresh\":\"Refresh\",\"tickets.generalCategory\":\"General\",\"tickets.updatedAt\":\"Updated {{date}}\",\"tickets.messageCount\":\"{{count}} messages\",\"tickets.unreadCount\":\"{{count}} unread\",\"tickets.noUnread\":\"No unread\",\"tickets.openCta\":\"Open →\",\"tickets.emptyTitle\":\"No tickets yet\",\"tickets.emptySubtitle\":\"Submit a ticket and we will respond as soon as possible.\",\"tickets.createPanelTitle\":\"Create a new ticket\",\"tickets.createPanelSubtitle\":\"Tell us what's happening and we'll reply as soon as possible.\",\"tickets.formTitle\":\"Title\",\"tickets.formTitlePlaceholder\":\"Describe your issue\",\"tickets.formCategory\":\"Category\",\"tickets.formMessage\":\"Message\",\"tickets.formMessagePlaceholder\":\"Describe your issue in detail…\",\"tickets.sending\":\"Sending…\",\"tickets.submitTicket\":\"Submit ticket\",\"ticketDetail.unknown\":\"Unknown\",\"ticketDetail.status.closed\":\"Closed\",\"ticketDetail.status.adminReply\":\"Admin Reply\",\"ticketDetail.status.userReply\":\"User Reply\",\"ticketDetail.status.open\":\"Open\",\"ticketDetail.invalidId\":\"Invalid ticket id.\",\"ticketDetail.emptyMessage\":\"Message cannot be empty.\",\"ticketDetail.you\":\"You\",\"ticketDetail.administrator\":\"Administrator\",\"ticketDetail.adminReplied\":\"Administrator replied to your ticket.\",\"ticketDetail.loadingTicket\":\"Loading ticket…\",\"ticketDetail.notFound\":\"Ticket not found\",\"ticketDetail.backToTickets\":\"Back to tickets\",\"ticketDetail.generalCategory\":\"General\",\"ticketDetail.closeTicket\":\"Close ticket\",\"ticketDetail.createdAt\":\"Created: {{date}}\",\"ticketDetail.updatedAt\":\"Updated: {{date}}\",\"ticketDetail.conversationTitle\":\"Conversation\",\"ticketDetail.conversationSubtitle\":\"All replies in one thread.\",\"ticketDetail.messageCount\":\"{{count}} messages\",\"ticketDetail.replyTitle\":\"Reply to ticket\",\"ticketDetail.replySubtitle\":\"Send a response to keep the conversation going.\",\"ticketDetail.replyPlaceholder\":\"Write your response...\",\"ticketDetail.sending\":\"Sending…\",\"ticketDetail.sendReply\":\"Send reply\",\"sharedFolder.pageTitleNamed\":\"{{name}} folder\",\"sharedFolder.pageTitleDefault\":\"Folder sharing\",\"sharedFolder.missingIdentifier\":\"Missing shared folder identifier.\",\"sharedFolder.loading\":\"Loading shared folder…\",\"sharedFolder.unavailable404\":\"This shared folder is unavailable or no longer public.\",\"sharedFolder.loadError\":\"The shared folder could not be loaded right now.\",\"sharedFolder.dataUnavailable\":\"Shared folder data is unavailable.\",\"sharedFolder.breadcrumbsAria\":\"Folder breadcrumbs\",\"sharedFolder.rootDirectory\":\"Root directory\",\"sharedFolder.foldersAria\":\"Folders\",\"sharedFolder.back\":\"Back\",\"sharedFolder.folderFallback\":\"Folder\",\"sharedFolder.filesAria\":\"Files\",\"sharedFolder.columnDuration\":\"Duration\",\"sharedFolder.columnAdded\":\"Added\",\"sharedFolder.empty\":\"This folder is empty.\",\"privacyPolicy.title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"privacyPolicy.description\":\"Learn how we collect, use, and safeguard personal information across the Byse platform.\",\"privacyPolicy.lastUpdated\":\"March 18, 2024\",\"privacyPolicy.contactLabel\":\"Contact us\",\"privacyPolicy.badge\":\"Privacy\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.general.title\":\"§1 General provisions\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.general.body\":\"This Privacy Policy explains how byse.com protects personal data and all other information shared on the Website. The document forms an integral annex to the Terms and Conditions.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.title\":\"§2 Definitions\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.intro\":\"The following terms are used in this document:\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.controller\":\"<strong>Data Controller:</strong> Video Hosting Services LLC, 13-15 Bolsunovska St., 8th floor, Kyiv, Ukraine 01014. All communications should be initiated via the <contactLink>contact page</contactLink>.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.website\":\"<strong>Website:</strong> https://byse.com and all related subpages.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.parties\":\"<strong>Parties:</strong> the Controller and the User collectively.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.definitions.user\":\"<strong>User:</strong> a natural person using the Website and submitting personal data.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.personalData.title\":\"§3 Personal data protection\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.personalData.body1\":\"Video Hosting Services LLC is the data controller within the meaning of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) of 27 April 2016.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.personalData.body2\":\"Personal data is processed only for the purposes, in the scope, and for the duration specified in the forms used to collect data on the Website.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.personalData.body3\":\"Data may be shared with trusted subcontractors providing IT services, accounting, administration, analytics (including Google Analytics), payment services (BitCoin, PayPal, WebMoney, Payoneer), and legal support.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.title\":\"§4 User rights\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.body1\":\"Users are responsible for keeping their personal data up to date.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.body2\":\"Users may request access to, rectification of, deletion of, or restriction of processing of their personal data. They may withdraw consent without affecting prior lawful processing, request data portability, and object to processing.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.body3\":\"Users may lodge complaints with the Head of the Office for Personal Data Protection.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.body4\":\"Providing personal data is voluntary; however, withholding consent prevents use of the Website.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.userRights.body5\":\"The Controller may refuse deletion if retention is legally required.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.technical.title\":\"§5 Technical data protection\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.technical.body1\":\"The Controller applies technical and organisational safeguards to protect personal data against accidental or intentional destruction, loss, modification, unauthorised disclosure, or access. Data is stored on secure servers in line with Polish legal requirements.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.technical.body2\":\"Regular backups are maintained to protect against data loss.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.technical.body3\":\"Servers and infrastructure are located in secure data centres accessible only to authorised personnel.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.technical.body4\":\"All data processing activities comply with applicable legal and technical standards for personal data protection.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.title\":\"§6 Cookie policy\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.body1\":\"The Website uses cookies to tailor the experience to Users and for statistical purposes. Cookies are small text files sent to a User’s device by the visited website.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.body2\":\"Two types of cookies are used: session cookies, which are removed when the browser is closed or the session ends, and persistent cookies, which remain until their expiry date or manual deletion.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.body3\":\"The Website utilises the following categories:\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type1\":\"<strong>Strictly necessary</strong> – enable the provision of core services such as authentication.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type2\":\"<strong>Secure</strong> – safeguard against misuse of Website services.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type3\":\"<strong>Performance</strong> – collect data on how Users interact with the Website.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type4\":\"<strong>Functionality</strong> – remember preferences such as language, region, font size, and layout.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type5\":\"<strong>Advertising</strong> – deliver more relevant advertising content.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.type6\":\"<strong>Integrating</strong> – support third-party tools used on the Website, e.g. Google Analytics, tawk.to.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.body4\":\"Third-party services embedded on the Website may also use cookies for login flows or personalised advertising.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.cookies.body5\":\"Browser settings can be adjusted to manage cookies. Continuing to use the Website without changing settings signifies acceptance of cookies.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.title\":\"§7 Logs\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.body1\":\"Like most websites, byse.com stores HTTP requests in server logs. The following information may be recorded:\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item1\":\"IP addresses of Users visiting the Website.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item2\":\"Time of each request and response time.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item3\":\"Client station name identified via HTTP.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item4\":\"Error information from HTTP transactions.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item5\":\"Previously visited URL (HTTP referrer).\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.item6\":\"Browser details.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.body2\":\"The data is used solely for Website administration.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.logs.body3\":\"Logs are stored indefinitely as auxiliary materials for administration and are accessible only to authorised personnel. Aggregated statistics generated from logs do not contain identifying information.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.title\":\"§8 Contact\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.body1\":\"Users may contact the Controller to:\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.item1\":\"Verify how their personal data is being processed.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.item2\":\"Request deletion of personal data in whole or in part.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.body2\":\"The Controller can be reached via the <contactLink>contact page</contactLink>.\",\"privacyPolicy.sections.contact.callout\":\"Byse reserves the right to update this policy without prior notice. Last updated: March 18, 2024.\",\"security.authRequired\":\"You need to sign in to manage your security settings.\",\"security.subtitle\":\"Review active sessions, manage trusted devices, and keep your account safe.\",\"security.refresh\":\"Refresh\",\"security.backToSettings\":\"Back to settings\",\"security.activeSessions\":\"Active sessions\",\"security.activeSessionsNote\":\"Review where your account is signed in and revoke access.\",\"security.loading\":\"Loading security activity…\",\"security.noActiveSessions\":\"No active sessions detected.\",\"upload.rootFolder\":\"Root\",\"inactiveFiles.loading\":\"Loading inactive files…\",\"inactiveFiles.title\":\"Inactive files\",\"trashCan.loading\":\"Loading deleted files…\",\"trashCan.title\":\"Trash\",\"security.title\":\"Security\",\"security.refreshed\":\"Security activity refreshed\",\"security.loadError\":\"Failed to load security activity\",\"security.updateError\":\"Failed to update devices\",\"security.sessionTerminated\":\"Session terminated\",\"security.confirmationSent\":\"Confirmation email sent\",\"security.removalConfirmationSent\":\"Removal confirmation email sent\",\"security.awaitingConfirmation\":\"Awaiting confirmation\",\"security.trusted\":\"Trusted\",\"security.verificationRequired\":\"Verification required\",\"security.unknownDevice\":\"Unknown device\",\"security.currentSession\":\"Current session\",\"security.trustedDeviceLabel\":\"Trusted device\",\"security.pending\":\"Pending\",\"security.trustDevice\":\"Trust device\",\"security.signOut\":\"Sign out\",\"security.ipLabel\":\"IP: {{ip}}\",\"security.lastActive\":\"Last active: {{date}}\",\"security.trustedDevices\":\"Trusted devices\",\"security.trustedDevicesNote\":\"Trusted devices skip OTP verification until you remove them.\",\"security.loadingTrustedDevices\":\"Loading trusted devices…\",\"security.noTrustedDevices\":\"No trusted devices yet.\",\"security.remove\":\"Remove\",\"security.deviceKeyLabel\":\"Device key: {{key}}\",\"security.lastSeen\":\"Last seen: {{date}}\",\"security.pendingSuffix\":\" (pending confirmation)\",\"upload.title\":\"Drag and drop upload\",\"upload.queueTitle\":\"Upload queue\",\"upload.uploading\":\"Uploading…\",\"upload.error.completedWithoutCode\":\"Upload completed without a file code.\",\"upload.error.failedWithStatus\":\"Upload failed with status {{status}}{{statusText}}\",\"upload.error.network\":\"Upload failed due to a network error.\",\"upload.notification.finished\":\"Upload finished successfully\",\"upload.notification.failed\":\"Upload failed\",\"inactiveFiles.loadingMore\":\"Loading more inactive files…\",\"inactiveFiles.deleteSelected\":\"Delete selected\",\"inactiveFiles.reclaimDeadSpace\":\"Reclaim space\",\"inactiveFiles.perPage\":\"Per page\",\"inactiveFiles.selection.empty\":\"No items to display\",\"inactiveFiles.selection.withSelected\":\"{{selected}} selected • Loaded {{loaded}} of {{total}} files\",\"inactiveFiles.selection.loaded\":\"Loaded {{loaded}} of {{total}} files\",\"inactiveFiles.validation.startThreshold\":\"Please provide a valid start threshold between {{min}} and {{max}} days.\",\"inactiveFiles.validation.endThreshold\":\"Please provide a valid end threshold between {{min}} and {{max}} days.\",\"inactiveFiles.validation.endMustBeGte\":\"The end threshold must be greater than or equal to the start threshold.\",\"inactiveFiles.empty\":\"No files have gone 90 days or more without views.\",\"inactiveFiles.subtitle\":\"These files have had no views for at least 90 days. Review and remove them to free up storage.\",\"inactiveFiles.clearSelection\":\"Clear selection\",\"inactiveFiles.table.ariaLabel\":\"Inactive files list\",\"inactiveFiles.table.selectAria\":\"Select\",\"inactiveFiles.table.file\":\"File\",\"inactiveFiles.table.lastActivity\":\"Last activity\",\"inactiveFiles.table.inactiveFor\":\"Inactive for\",\"inactiveFiles.table.views\":\"Views\",\"inactiveFiles.table.size\":\"Size\",\"inactiveFiles.table.duration\":\"Duration\",\"inactiveFiles.table.status\":\"Status\",\"inactiveFiles.table.selectFileAria\":\"Select {{title}}\",\"inactiveFiles.table.openFilePage\":\"Open file page\",\"inactiveFiles.table.inactiveForValue\":\"inactive for {{value}}\",\"inactiveFiles.table.inactiveOver90\":\"inactive for over 90 days\",\"inactiveFiles.table.noViews90Days\":\"No views for 90+ days\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.inactiveTitle\":\"Inactive files\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.inactiveSubtitle\":\"No views in the last 90+ days\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.storageTitle\":\"Storage on this page\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.storageSubtitle\":\"Total size of the files listed below\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.yearTitle\":\"Inactive for 1+ year\",\"inactiveFiles.summary.yearSubtitle\":\"Files shown on this page\",\"inactiveFiles.pagination.loading\":\"Loading…\",\"inactiveFiles.pagination.loadMore\":\"Load more\",\"inactiveFiles.pagination.status\":\"Loaded page {{page}} of {{totalPages}}\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteSelected.title\":\"Delete selected inactive files\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.removing\":\"Removing…\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteSelected.confirm\":\"Delete selected files\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.entity.file\":\"file\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.entity.files\":\"files\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteSelected.body\":\"You are about to permanently delete {{count}} selected inactive {{entity}}.\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteSelected.hint\":\"This action cannot be undone.\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.title\":\"Delete inactive files\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.confirm\":\"Delete inactive files\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.body\":\"This will permanently delete files with no views for at least the selected number of days. You can also set an optional upper bound.\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.thresholdHint\":\"Set the inactivity threshold before confirming.\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.fromLabel\":\"Delete files inactive from (days)\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.toLabel\":\"Delete files inactive up to (days, optional)\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.rangeHint\":\"Example: 90 to 180 days. Leave the upper bound empty to delete files inactive for 90+ days.\",\"inactiveFiles.modal.deleteInactive.counter\":\"Files inactive for 90+ days: {{count}}.\",\"trashCan.noFiles\":\"No deleted files found.\",\"trashCan.subtitle\":\"Review recently deleted files and check which ones can still be restored.\",\"trashCan.perPage\":\"Per page\",\"trashCan.summaryDeletedTitle\":\"Deleted files\",\"trashCan.summaryDeletedSubtitle\":\"Across your account\",\"trashCan.summaryRestorableTitle\":\"Restorable (this page)\",\"trashCan.summaryRestorableSubtitle\":\"Eligible for recovery\",\"trashCan.summaryRemovedByYouTitle\":\"Removed by you\",\"trashCan.summaryRemovedByYouSubtitle\":\"On the current page\",\"customDomains.authRequired\":\"Sign in to manage custom domains. You'll be redirected if your session has expired.\",\"customDomains.title\":\"Custom domains\",\"customDomains.nameserverTitle\":\"Update your nameserver records\",\"customDomains.preferencesTitle\":\"Domain preferences\",\"customDomains.addDomainTitle\":\"Add a custom domain\",\"customDomains.defaultEmbedTitle\":\"Default embed domain\",\"customDomains.configuredTitle\":\"Configured domains\",\"customDomains.failedToLoad\":\"Failed to load domains\",\"customDomains.subtitle\":\"Configure branded domains for embeds and manage DNS activation.\",\"customDomains.copy\":\"Copy\",\"customDomains.copied\":\"Copied\",\"customDomains.defaultBadge\":\"Default\",\"customDomains.awaitingDns\":\"Awaiting DNS update — point your nameservers to the records below.\",\"customDomains.domainConfigurationAria\":\"Domain configuration\",\"customDomains.actionRequire